1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:02,930
Licenses issued is not AI adoption.

2
00:00:03,130 --> 00:00:06,430
Licenses assigned, logins, prompts sent. Easy to count. They say little.

3
00:00:06,630 --> 00:00:12,430
Instead, count weekly users on a real task, tasks done faster or better, and people still using it after week four.

4
00:00:12,630 --> 00:00:17,930
In this illustrative example, every seat has a license, but only eighteen percent use it weekly on real work. Report the second number.

5
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:22,930
Count use, not licenses. Share this with your AI rollout team.
